to other australian blushes  it probably was but yeah there's a lot  better products on the market now and  with this product  i think if you're quite pale then it  works quite well  and i think that's the case with a lot  of benefit products to be honest  a lot of them are designed for pale  people so  i switched to a lot more pigmented  blushes now that have a bigger shade  range  one of my favorites is milani so i hope  that was an interesting trip down memory  lane  do you have products that you've just  completely given up on as well let me  know in the comments  if you liked the video click the like  you can also subscribe to my channel  you can also follow me on instagram at  la muffin beauty science and check out  my blog as well  see you next time for more nerdy beauty  talk

